repository-code: "https://github.com/ZuhaFatima96/IceWatch-A-Multimodal-Deep-Learning-Framework-for-Early-Warning-of-GLOFs"
abstract: >-
  IceWatch combines a convolutional classifier of Sentinel-2 scenes (RiskFlow),
  forecasts of glacier velocity from ITS_LIVE (TerraFlow) and of MODIS land-surface
  temperature (TempFlow), and a probabilistic fusion stage (FusionFlow). It is
  evaluated at the ice-dammed lake of Shisper Glacier, Karakoram, which drained
  four times between 2019 and 2022, and with a transfer test on 103 other
  ice-dammed lakes.
